@startuml 双向数据流(上传与下载)
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 双向数据流:上传(MCP 发数据)与下载(MCP 收数据)对称

participant "MCP\n(本地)" as M
participant "串口\n(传输层)" as S
participant "设备\n(rz / sz)" as D

== 上传:MCP 发数据, 设备接收 ==

M -> M  : 本地文件 createReadStream\n分块 8KiB
M -> M  : transfer.send(chunk)\nzmodem.js 编码为 ZDATA 帧
M -> S  : set_sender 回调\nshell.rawWrite(Buffer)  写
S -> D  : ZDATA 数据帧
D --> S : 设备回执 (ZRPOS / ZACK / ZEOF)
S -> M  : data 事件\nattachRawReceiver
M -> M  : session.consume\nzmodem.js 解析

== 下载:MCP 收数据, 设备发送 ==

M -> M  : MCP 控制帧\n(ZRINIT / ZFIN) zmodem.js 编码
M -> S  : set_sender 回调\nshell.rawWrite(Buffer)  写
S -> D  : ZRINIT / ZFIN 控制帧
D --> S : 设备数据 (ZFILE / ZDATA)
S -> M  : data 事件\nattachRawReceiver
M -> M  : session.consume\nzmodem.js 解析
M -> M  : offer 事件 / on_input 回调\nwriteStream 流式写盘

note over M
  上传与下载的字节流向对称,
  区别仅在于"谁发数据、谁发控制帧"
end note

@enduml
